CORE
main.c
--no-malloc-may-fail
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .*: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* the heap object is reachable: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
pointer handling for concurrency is unsound
--
A local copy of a shared pointer that a thread executed later in symbolic
execution sets to a heap object may point to that object.
